msgid "An appointment gets you to Marcus; it does not waive the company, account, credit, payment history, age or collateral requirements."
msgstr "預約能安排與 Marcus 洽談，仍須符合公司、帳戶、信用、繳款紀錄、成立天數或擔保資產等資格。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "An employee who takes your van out on one posted run each workday and banks the fee. They plan the route less well than you do."
msgstr "每個工作日開你的貨車跑一趟外送、把運費收進帳上的員工。他們排路線沒有你排得好。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "An office gives your company desks for staff, more storage and a proper address. Rent is charged every month."
msgstr "辦公室讓公司有員工座位、更多倉儲空間和正式地址。每月收租。"

#: data/npcs/ana.json
msgid "Ana"
msgstr "Ana"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "Ana at City Hall. The Payments Integrity Act is in force. Commercial importers need an import licence: $450 a year, at the permits kiosk. There's a monthly compliance cost now too."
msgstr "我是市政廳的 Ana。《支付誠信法》生效了。商業進口商需要進口執照：一年 $450，到許可服務站辦。現在每個月還有一筆合規費用。"

#: data/jobs/city_clerk.json
msgid "Ana shows you the queue trick: ticket numbers are a suggestion."
msgstr "Ana 教你排隊的訣竅：號碼牌只是參考。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/registration_modal.gd:25
msgid "Ana: \"All done. Congratulations. Open a business account at Nexus Bank and you're set.\""
msgstr "Ana：「都辦好了，恭喜。再去 Nexus 銀行開個企業帳戶就搞定了。」"

#: data/world/years.json
msgid "Analysts: 'Faster rails, thinner buffers.'"
msgstr "分析師：「管道更快，緩衝更薄。」"

#: data/dialogue/lina_reopened.json
msgid "And expect paperwork. Regulators read the same news you did."
msgstr "還有，準備好面對文件吧。監管單位看的新聞跟你一樣。"

#: data/dialogue/okafor_intro.json
msgid "And the rent is due whether anyone buys a coffee or not. I say that to everyone. Some people listen."
msgstr "還有，不管有沒有人買咖啡，房租都照收。這句話我跟每個人都說。有些人聽進去了。"

#: data/dialogue/okafor_tenant.json
msgid "And watch the pastries. What you don't sell by closing goes in the bin, and the bin doesn't pay rent."
msgstr "還有，糕點要算好。打烊前賣不掉的只能丟，垃圾桶可不會幫你付房租。"

#: data/economy/staff.json
msgid "Answers customers and settles returns for you (replace if in stock, otherwise refund)."
msgstr "回覆客人、幫你處理退貨（有庫存就換貨，否則退款）。"

