msgid "You need the product in hand to photograph it."
msgstr "商品要在手上才能拍照。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "You need: recycled packaging (Company OS → Operations) and a green product listed on ShopLane."
msgstr "條件：使用回收包材（Company OS → 營運），並在 ShopLane 上架一項綠色商品。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "You never pay for goods that don't show up, and the supplier knows the money is there. Useful with a supplier you haven't worked with before."
msgstr "貨沒到就不用付錢，供應商也知道錢確實準備好了。跟第一次合作的供應商交易時特別有用。"

#: scripts/sim/company.gd:89
msgid "You only have %s personally."
msgstr "你個人只有 %s。"

