msgstr "你欠別人（供應商）"

#: scripts/sim/acquisition.gd:67
msgid "You own all of it, so the whole amount is yours: %s."
msgstr "公司全部歸你，所以整筆都是你的：%s。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/pack_game.gd:39
msgid "You pack %d by hand; the other %d get packed the same way once you have the rhythm."
msgstr "你親手打包 %d 張；上手之後，其餘 %d 張照同樣的水準打包。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "You packed boxes until 1 AM again, didn't you. You need help. Like, a person."
msgstr "你又打包到凌晨一點了對吧。你需要幫手，我是說，一個人。"

#: scripts/frontend/arrival_scene.gd:97
msgid "You quit your job. You have savings, a laptop, a phone — and a lease."
msgstr "你辭掉了工作。你有一筆存款、一台筆電、一支手機——還有一紙租約。"

#: data/dialogue/ken_supply_shock.json
msgid "You saw the port? Forty ships waiting. Our containers are on three of them."
msgstr "你看到港口了嗎？四十艘船在排隊，我們的貨櫃在其中三艘上。"

#: data/dialogue/lina_bridge.json
msgid "You saw. The bridge underneath our rail was exploited. Not my contract: the bridge. It doesn't matter to anyone whose money is stuck."
msgstr "你看到了。我們管道底下的跨鏈橋被駭了。不是我的合約，是那座橋。對錢被卡住的人來說，這沒差別。"

#: data/jobs/cowork_host.json
msgid "You set up chairs for a pitch night. Two founders argue about pricing the whole time."
msgstr "你為提案之夜排椅子。兩位創辦人整晚都在吵定價。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "You survived the cash crunch. Most people don't even know they're in one."
msgstr "你撐過了現金危機。很多人連自己在危機裡都不知道。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/route_game.gd:150
msgid "You took the scenic route. The fuel gauge noticed."
msgstr "你走了風景路線，油表都看在眼裡。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "You turned a laptop and $30,000 into something a stranger wants to buy. Whatever you told Victor, I'm proud of you."
msgstr "你用一台筆電和 $30,000，做出了陌生人想買下的東西。不管你跟 Victor 說了什麼，我都以你為榮。"

#: data/dialogue/victor_offer.json
msgid "You want to buy {company}?"
msgstr "你想買下 {company}？"

#: scripts/sim/insolvency.gd:46
msgid "You'd need %s of your own money."
msgstr "你需要拿出自己的 %s。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/business_board.gd:158
msgid "You're a freelance consultant now. Today's gigs are in Company OS → Freelance."
msgstr "你現在是自由接案顧問了。今天的案子在 Company OS → 接案。"

#: scripts/sim/saas.gd:48
msgid "You're already building a product."
msgstr "你已經在開發一個產品了。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/company_os.gd:457
