#: scripts/ui/tutorial.gd:74
msgid "You're carrying the parcel. Walk to PostPoint in Riverside and hand it over at the counter."
msgstr "你正拿著包裹。走到河濱區的 PostPoint，在櫃台交寄。"

#: data/dialogue/okafor_intro.json
msgid "You're here about the corner unit, I can tell. Everybody looks at it the same way."
msgstr "你是為了轉角那間店面來的吧，我看得出來。每個人看它的眼神都一樣。"

