#: scripts/sim/careers.gd:167
msgid "You've earned it: you're our new %s. New rate: $%d an hour."
msgstr "這是你應得的：你是我們新的%s。新時薪：每小時 $%d。"

#: data/dialogue/sam_intro.json
msgid "You've got the look of someone whose parcels keep going the long way round. A van fixes that."
msgstr "你看起來就像包裹老是繞遠路的人。有一台貨車就解決了。"

#: scripts/sim/ecommerce.gd:835
msgid "You've sold %s of your %s personal seller limit this month. Register a business to lift it."
msgstr "你這個月已經賣了 %s，個人賣家上限是 %s。登記公司就能解除限制。"

